tedly. \n\n**Submission:**  \nThe root cause of the fault is the absence of the `server-key.pem` SSL private key file in the `nacosdb-mysql` Secret or ConfigMap, resulting in an SSL error and pod restarts.", additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'refusal': None, 'reasoning': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': Usage(completion_tokens=513, prompt_tokens=14772, total_tokens=15285, completion_tokens_details=None, prompt_tokens_details=None), 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfef2-a46a-73e1-9da8-c4032bc18d44-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 14772, 'output_tokens': 513, 'total_tokens': 15285}), HumanMessage(content='Now generate a tool call according to your last chosen tool.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='546732e9-f4d9-41d4-8320-c709f067d52b')]]
